            "notes": "The permission required depends on whether the object already exists in the bucket: is required when an object with that name doesn't already exist in the bucket. is required when an object with that name already exists in the bucket. For a customer-managed key encrypted bucket, the objectstorage-<location> subject must have KEY_ENCRYPT."
